    "Sheafnote asks for Face ID, Touch ID or your device passcode when you open it, and hides its contents in the app switcher. To lock a single notebook, touch and hold it in the library and choose Lock. Locks only control who can open the app on this device; your notes and iCloud sync are not changed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sheafnote asks for Face ID, Touch ID or your device passcode when you open it, and hides its contents in the app switcher. To lock a single notebook, touch and hold it in the library and choose Lock. Locks only control who can open the app on this device; your notes and iCloud sync are not changed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
